      "topics": [
        "family-school",
        "love-education"
      ],
      "excerpt": "We create a human being through love — the love of father for mother and mother for father, through a deep faith in the beauty and dignity of a human being. Beautiful children grow up in families where the mother and father truly love each other and at the same time love and respect other people. I can immediately recognise a child whose parents share a deep, heartfelt, beautiful and devoted love for each other. Such a child has an inner peace and calm, robust psychological health, a sincere faith in human beauty, faith in the teacher s word, and a sensitivity to the subtle means of influencing the human soul — to a kind word and to beauty.",
